Z||000014||PKFieroGT||05-01-2001||11:37 AM||||Hey all,<P>DON'T use a dremmel tool unless you like gouging your aluminum wheels!!! I have a set of Factory GT style wheels (Honeycomb style) and I tried using my Dremmel tool to get into all the crevices(sp?). what a Pain in the A**!! Unless there's a better attachment fot the dremmel (I used fine sanding drums, wire brush was toast after a minute!!), I would not recommend a dremmel for this work... Just my 2cents..<P>PKFieroGT||||reg||1
